README — Example 1: Wood–Berry Binary Distillation Column

Environment
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- GNU Octave (paper uses Octave 11.3.0; recommended >= 7.0)
- Required packages: control, optim
- Run:  pkg load control optim   (main.m loads them automatically)
- Entry point for Example 1:  main

