TABLE 1   Main notation used throughout the paper
          Generated by: none (typeset in the manuscript, not code-generated)

TABLE 2   Cross-validation results for DyPLS-MIMO-ARX model selection
          Generated by: run_tuning.m  (calls tune_hyperparameters.m)
          Note: run_tuning.m is a standalone script, not launched by main.m.

TABLE 3   Free-run validation on the independent test set (batch-wise)
          Generated by: evaluate_on_test_set.m  (called from main.m)

